WEBVTT

00:05.030 --> 00:06.740
I've had enough of being the Son of God!

00:07.540 --> 00:11.360
I'll become human, and win her over all by myself!

00:13.640 --> 00:15.110
Samatarou's going to become human?

00:16.370 --> 00:19.090
That can't be... If that happens, an angel like me...

00:21.570 --> 00:23.840
You really are serious about this, huh?

00:24.330 --> 00:25.420
Of course I am!

00:25.880 --> 00:29.110
Why... why would you want to become human?

00:29.240 --> 00:30.450
What are you thinking?

00:31.540 --> 00:33.730
This has nothing to do with you, okay?

00:35.830 --> 00:36.600
Hey...

00:36.600 --> 00:37.200
Come with me.

00:38.930 --> 00:43.960
W-wait! What are you... Let me go! C'mon, let me go!

00:44.400 --> 00:46.750
Just what have you been living for all this time?

00:47.120 --> 00:48.870
You're going to become God in the future, right?

00:49.260 --> 00:52.000
And you still want to become human just 'cause you fell in love?

00:52.180 --> 00:54.170
Ha. You've gotta be kidding me.

00:54.370 --> 00:56.290
Kumiko's going to transfer really soon.

00:56.540 --> 00:57.550
I have no time!

00:57.780 --> 01:00.760
If this keeps up... If I stay like this... It'll be no good.

01:01.250 --> 01:02.560
What about me?

01:03.050 --> 01:07.080
Even though I've been doing my best to ensure that you become a splendid God all this time...

01:07.990 --> 01:09.720
You don't get it at all!

01:09.870 --> 01:11.720
You're the one who doesn't get it!

01:11.920 --> 01:13.830
I've had to deal with a lot, too!

01:14.240 --> 01:18.220
I was worried about things not working out so much that I couldn't sleep one wink at night!

01:18.350 --> 01:21.810
I always thought "I should write in my diary," but there was never anything good to write about.

01:22.150 --> 01:25.450
I finally wrote "I've had enough of this!", but you just had to get in my way!

01:25.530 --> 01:29.560
This time... this time for sure, let me do everything on my own!

01:29.920 --> 01:32.660
I'm begging you. Don't get in my way!

01:36.430 --> 01:41.260
I'm... an angel, and that's all I've ever known.

01:42.300 --> 01:44.750
I exist for your sake. I've been doing my best just for you.

01:46.270 --> 01:49.350
If you became human, what'd happen to me?

01:49.840 --> 01:54.020
You'll be free. You'll be able to do whatever you want from now on.

01:54.980 --> 01:56.170
All you care about is yourself.

01:57.430 --> 01:59.160
That won't change whether you're a god or a human.

02:28.680 --> 02:34.000
dare mo shiranai basho de

02:28.680 --> 02:34.000
In a place unknown to everyone

02:34.820 --> 02:39.680
asa ga umare hajimeru

02:34.820 --> 02:39.680
The dawn is being born

02:40.040 --> 02:46.120
hoshi inotta negai wo ima wa

02:40.040 --> 02:46.120
The wishes you made upon a star

02:46.120 --> 02:52.020
hikari wo naku shita no ue ni koborete iru

02:46.120 --> 02:52.020
Are spilling forth from where the light had vanished

02:52.320 --> 03:00.930
sotto sukuu tame ni te wo nobasu

02:52.320 --> 03:00.930
I softly extend my hand to rescue you

03:04.120 --> 03:07.250
boku no koe wa sekai wo koete

03:04.120 --> 03:07.250
And my voice envelops the entire world

03:07.270 --> 03:10.340
itsu ka kimi ni tadoritsuku darou

03:07.270 --> 03:10.340
Perhaps some day it will struggle its way to you

03:10.360 --> 03:13.270
toiki morashi yume ga oitemo

03:10.360 --> 03:13.270
Even if you must abandon your dreams, exhale deeply

03:13.520 --> 03:16.410
douka kesshite wasurenu you ni

03:13.520 --> 03:16.410
And you'll never really lose them

03:16.410 --> 03:19.490
boku no yubi ga subete ni fureru

03:16.410 --> 03:19.490
My fingers touch all of creation

03:19.490 --> 03:24.880
tobira akete haruka kanata e

03:19.490 --> 03:24.880
Open the door and escape to a distant place

03:43.610 --> 03:46.350
Tenko's Tears Upon Her Glittering Wings

03:43.610 --> 03:46.350
Timing, Editing, Encoding, "Translation", Muxing: Chikushou

03:50.510 --> 03:52.060
Tenko's crying, you know!

03:52.420 --> 03:56.730
Only for now. If I become human, I'll set her free.

03:57.220 --> 03:58.730
It's better to be free, isn't it?

04:00.320 --> 04:01.740
I want to become human!

04:02.080 --> 04:03.370
And what'll you do if that happens?

04:03.550 --> 04:07.690
I'll become human, and convey my feelings to her all on my own.

04:08.330 --> 04:10.400
Isn't what you're doing now getting through to her?

04:10.840 --> 04:12.400
No, that's different.

04:12.590 --> 04:18.920
All this time... you, Ma, Sis, Meme, and Tenko have all sheltered me too much.

04:19.390 --> 04:24.970
That's why I had no idea what I was supposed to say when someone I really cared about showed up.

04:25.170 --> 04:28.330
Isn't that your own fault?

04:28.330 --> 04:29.620
No, it's because of this divine power!

04:31.220 --> 04:32.410
I won't be able to turn you back.

04:33.160 --> 04:33.880
Once you become human...

04:33.880 --> 04:35.120
JUST DO IT ALREADY!

04:36.700 --> 04:37.390
Got it.

04:38.690 --> 04:41.730
Samatarou, you shall be human from this morning forth.

04:41.990 --> 04:43.900
Your privileges as a good shall will be revoked.

04:44.290 --> 04:47.470
Everything up until this point will have started over from the beginning!

04:52.760 --> 04:53.570
Good night.

05:17.820 --> 05:20.020
Ugh? It's already this late?

05:20.020 --> 05:21.080
Why?!

05:22.470 --> 05:23.890
Oh shit, oh shit, oh shit!

05:24.280 --> 05:26.140
I'm screwed! Screwed!

05:27.640 --> 05:29.910
Hey Sis, move over. Let me wash my face!

05:30.150 --> 05:33.060
No way. I'm not done blow-drying my hair yet.

05:33.170 --> 05:35.540
Eh, why are you dolling yourself up?

05:35.540 --> 05:36.860
Hurry it up!

05:37.220 --> 05:38.390
You get a boyfriend or something?

05:38.390 --> 05:42.260
Eh? Ah, come on, you little tease!

05:42.780 --> 05:44.120
Keep it a secret from everyone, okay?

05:46.810 --> 05:50.550
That's why I felt it was necessary to clearly elaborate on this issue...

05:50.450 --> 05:51.850
Ma, where's the food?

05:52.700 --> 05:55.360
Be quiet. I'm watching TV.

05:55.900 --> 05:58.330
Sorry... Umm... Where's the food?

05:58.640 --> 06:01.220
What're you talking about? If you eat, you're gonna be late.

06:02.200 --> 06:03.940
Hurry up and get yourself to school.

06:04.370 --> 06:05.460
O-okay.

06:08.660 --> 06:10.630
Oh yeah. Where's Tenko?

06:10.960 --> 06:11.890
She go ahead of me?

06:11.940 --> 06:13.550
Tenko? Who's that?

06:15.070 --> 06:16.650
Hurry up and get moving!

06:19.440 --> 06:21.420
Ah! Good morning, Bro!

06:21.420 --> 06:23.000
Y-yeah.

06:27.340 --> 06:29.020
Meme, your shoes are on the wrong feet.

06:29.170 --> 06:29.740
Eh?

06:30.930 --> 06:32.170
Ehhhh?

06:32.430 --> 06:35.350
Ah, you're right! I messed up again!

06:48.890 --> 06:50.410
Why is there a red light?

06:55.140 --> 06:57.000
What's this sensation?

06:58.130 --> 06:59.040
Could it be...

07:00.540 --> 07:02.290
This is hunger?

07:04.670 --> 07:06.740
This is what it's like to be human?

07:13.380 --> 07:15.290
Hey, Tenko, you...

07:16.480 --> 07:16.890
Yo.

07:17.820 --> 07:20.070
Shinichi, do you know what happened to Tenko?

07:20.970 --> 07:23.170
Why isn't Tenko's seat here anymore?

07:23.220 --> 07:25.310
Huh? Who's Tenko?

07:25.570 --> 07:28.720
Don't screw with me. That was always where Tenko sat.

07:29.000 --> 07:31.690
The place next to you's always been an empty seat.

07:31.850 --> 07:32.130
Eh?

07:32.750 --> 07:33.400
Shinichi!

07:37.940 --> 07:38.720
Later man.

07:40.910 --> 07:43.190
Hey Kumiko. Looks like he's got an imaginary woman or something.

07:43.240 --> 07:44.190
So lame!

07:44.190 --> 07:46.860
<i>Acting all screwy this early in the morning....</i>

07:47.000 --> 07:47.840
<i>Sure is...</i>

07:49.460 --> 07:52.020
Kumiko, I need to talk to you, but...

07:52.230 --> 07:52.900
What about?

07:53.750 --> 07:56.830
I can't say it here, so come meet me behind the gym later.

07:57.890 --> 08:00.440
Why do we have to go all the way out there?

08:00.830 --> 08:02.070
Isn't here good enough?

08:02.510 --> 08:04.680
Sorry... It's important, so...

08:05.070 --> 08:05.660
See you later.

08:18.760 --> 08:20.000
It's like, a pain.

08:20.440 --> 08:24.000
It's my last day here, so I guess I can hear him out just this once.

08:24.210 --> 08:26.150
Yeah. Kay. I'll talk you later.

08:27.310 --> 08:28.450
So, what's up?

08:29.250 --> 08:30.570
I'm pretty busy, you know.

08:30.590 --> 08:31.620
S-sorry.

08:31.830 --> 08:33.670
If you've got something to say, hurry up and do it.

08:34.050 --> 08:35.760
Everyone's waiting for me.

08:37.460 --> 08:38.240
Umm, like...

08:38.940 --> 08:41.110
Saying this all of the sudden is, umm...

08:41.780 --> 08:43.300
I don't know how you'll react, but....

08:43.350 --> 08:43.900
Hm?

08:44.150 --> 08:44.750
Umm...

08:46.480 --> 08:49.370
Uh, like, do you know about Tenko?

08:49.580 --> 08:51.180
Huh? What do you mean?

08:51.360 --> 08:56.220
She's a girl who's always been with me, and she used to sit next to me, but...

08:56.630 --> 08:57.410
Don't know her?

08:57.790 --> 08:58.930
Nope.

08:59.760 --> 09:00.660
Huh?

09:00.820 --> 09:02.660
I'm not going to confess to her?

09:03.370 --> 09:05.880
Why am I asking about Tenko?

09:06.940 --> 09:09.370
I only knew you for a little while, but take care.

09:09.570 --> 09:10.010
Eh?

09:10.680 --> 09:15.150
Tomorrow afternoon at 3, I'll be taking the bullet train to Osaka.

09:15.410 --> 09:19.160
We basically just met, but who knows if we'll meet again or something.

09:19.700 --> 09:21.590
I've got stuff to do, so I'm gonna go now.

09:22.670 --> 09:23.270
See ya.

09:33.110 --> 09:35.770
Sis, you don't know about Tenko?

09:38.170 --> 09:40.390
Meme, you'd definitely know...

09:41.940 --> 09:43.570
Tenko. You know, Tenko?

09:46.540 --> 09:51.110
Ma, I'll wake up on time from tomorrow on, so please respond.

09:51.110 --> 09:52.070
Come on.

09:55.790 --> 09:58.190
Pops, you're watching me, aren't you?

09:58.680 --> 10:00.030
Hey, Pops!

10:00.720 --> 10:02.530
Anyone's fine! Just answer me!

10:03.020 --> 10:04.880
SOMEONE ANSWER ME!

10:14.570 --> 10:15.110
Tenko!

10:24.620 --> 10:26.380
Oh yeah. That key holder.

10:28.060 --> 10:28.620
It's gone.

11:00.890 --> 11:01.900
This store...

11:07.240 --> 11:08.100
<i>Welcome.</i>

11:12.230 --> 11:13.440
<i>A present for your girlfriend?</i>

11:14.560 --> 11:16.700
No.  She's not my girlfriend.

11:17.160 --> 11:19.310
I guess she was someone I liked.

11:19.590 --> 11:20.990
I don't really know.

11:21.270 --> 11:21.920
What's with that?

11:22.670 --> 11:25.120
There's this friend I was always close to.

11:25.720 --> 11:27.210
But she disappeared.

11:27.860 --> 11:32.820
So then, you realized that friend of yours is more important than the girl you liked?

11:33.440 --> 11:37.500
I dunno. I know I really did like that girl.

11:38.190 --> 11:39.590
But that friend, too...

11:40.650 --> 11:42.020
Well, she was more than a friend.

11:42.350 --> 11:44.020
I'm worried about her.

11:44.390 --> 11:45.580
You two-timing bastard!

11:52.140 --> 11:53.900
Two-timing is a bad idea.

11:53.930 --> 11:55.090
You two-timer.

12:08.680 --> 12:09.400
Hm?

12:22.570 --> 12:25.490
You thought you liked her, but maybe you really didn't. Something like that?

12:26.090 --> 12:28.880
You thought you could just keep things up like they were, but that didn't work out, huh?

12:29.240 --> 12:30.090
Wasn't it tough?

12:31.330 --> 12:32.570
Well, I am at that age...

12:32.910 --> 12:33.970
I give up.

12:34.540 --> 12:35.670
So, what're you gonna do?

12:36.190 --> 12:38.950
The girl you might like is moving to Osaka today, right?

12:39.290 --> 12:41.150
Is that okay? Not telling her your feelings.

12:41.610 --> 12:44.330
I'm not really sure what I'm supposed to tell her.

12:44.740 --> 12:47.320
Even if you don't know, you should at least try to wrap things up.

12:47.740 --> 12:52.130
It's okay. I've never been able to get my feelings across to anyone, anyway.

12:58.330 --> 13:00.160
Not expressing your feelings is forbidden!

13:00.600 --> 13:03.130
If you keep stuff like that bottled up inside, your heart'll rot!

13:05.170 --> 13:07.090
Kinda like this...

13:07.470 --> 13:09.900
You'll be saying, "this is hopeless" or something.

13:10.650 --> 13:13.910
You look kind of like the girl I'm worried about.

13:14.420 --> 13:17.320
What do you think you're doing? Nothing's gonna happen if you flirt with me.

13:18.760 --> 13:19.720
You really do look like her.

13:21.660 --> 13:24.630
You know, way back when, I also had a guy I liked.

13:25.480 --> 13:28.550
That idiot was the only guy I ever really liked.

13:29.510 --> 13:32.480
When we kids, we'd pretend we were newly-weds.

13:34.110 --> 13:37.700
I'd say stuff to him like, "I love you".

13:38.060 --> 13:39.040
Trying to act all grown-up.

13:41.240 --> 13:46.530
Then, I'd get so red you'd think steam might come out of the top of my head or something.

13:47.000 --> 13:47.820
That's when I knew...

13:48.730 --> 13:50.330
That I loved him.

13:51.180 --> 13:55.730
Now that you mention it, Tenko did used to do things like that.

13:56.660 --> 13:58.420
But, why is this girl saying that?

13:59.420 --> 14:03.350
I regret it, you know. It would've been nice if my feelings got through to him.

14:03.970 --> 14:05.310
That's why you should tell her.

14:06.240 --> 14:07.330
Tell her your feelings.

14:07.560 --> 14:09.400
Concisely and politely, okay?

14:10.090 --> 14:10.610
Got it?

14:11.440 --> 14:14.230
But... my voice has never gotten through to anyone.

14:14.900 --> 14:20.010
Pops or Ma... Sis or Meme... I never got through to them.

14:23.190 --> 14:23.910
It's alright.

14:24.710 --> 14:26.940
Your voice is reaching me.

14:27.610 --> 14:30.220
Your sadness and your loneliness...

14:30.710 --> 14:32.980
They're resonating inside me, okay?

14:38.120 --> 14:41.040
This is the best item I've got.

14:44.860 --> 14:46.260
A music box!

14:54.580 --> 14:55.690
I want this!

14:55.790 --> 14:57.240
I really want it!

14:57.290 --> 14:58.090
I'll give it to you.

14:58.350 --> 14:59.510
Huh? But...

14:59.950 --> 15:03.260
Just take it, and give it to the person you feel is most important.

15:23.330 --> 15:24.830
Samatarou...

15:26.560 --> 15:27.540
C'mon. Let's go.

15:27.830 --> 15:29.430
Eh? Where to?

15:30.150 --> 15:31.880
To where that girl who's going to Osaka is.

15:32.450 --> 15:34.260
We've still got some time before the bullet train leaves, right?

15:36.090 --> 15:38.420
Just barely... No, I don't think we'll make it.

15:39.940 --> 15:41.980
Don't give up just because you think it might be too late!

15:42.270 --> 15:43.020
Okay?

15:45.240 --> 15:46.090
Ah, that's...

15:46.370 --> 15:46.920
Eh?

15:47.640 --> 15:49.860
Ah, this? Corny, huh?

15:50.170 --> 15:52.060
It's a present from that guy I was telling you about.

15:51.650 --> 15:52.910
I've bought this for you, my beloved *sound of razzing your tongue*

15:53.580 --> 15:56.970
She... Wrote something like that?

15:58.180 --> 15:59.190
Alright. Get on.

16:00.690 --> 16:01.690
Alright!

16:02.210 --> 16:03.760
Okay, let's ride!

16:11.430 --> 16:12.960
Damn, so fast!

16:17.970 --> 16:19.440
Today's got a good feeling to it.

16:19.700 --> 16:21.330
None of the lights are turning red.

16:21.790 --> 16:23.320
Maybe you're good luck or something!

16:23.470 --> 16:25.540
Awesome. Can this thing fly?

16:26.600 --> 16:28.330
If it had wings or something, it probably could!

16:29.750 --> 16:31.530
Okay, time to burn some rubber!

16:36.880 --> 16:38.010
That felt good, huh?

16:38.560 --> 16:40.370
Yea! It's like I'm totally refreshed.

16:40.620 --> 16:43.830
But... I'm sorry I couldn't make it here on time for you.

16:44.520 --> 16:45.480
Hey, what're you doing?

16:46.310 --> 16:48.990
Don't tell me you're gonna chase after the bullet train on the bike?

16:49.720 --> 16:50.290
Yeah.

16:52.200 --> 16:54.370
There's no way you could keep up with the bullet train.

16:55.840 --> 16:57.440
Hurry up and get on behind me.

16:57.930 --> 17:00.150
Uh, wait a sec. This is my bike!

17:03.670 --> 17:05.220
Hey, c'mon! You're gunning it too hard.

17:10.470 --> 17:13.340
The light turned red! Red! Red means stop!

17:13.550 --> 17:14.540
It's alright!

17:15.340 --> 17:15.940
Change!

17:23.490 --> 17:26.560
Why? Was it always this easy to ride a motorcycle in Japan?

17:28.940 --> 17:30.640
W-wait! There's a corner co--

17:38.320 --> 17:40.760
What the? What kind of trick are you using?

17:42.810 --> 17:45.960
Damn. Looks like we can't catch up to the bullet train on the ground!

17:46.130 --> 17:47.370
Time to hit the sky!

17:47.630 --> 17:48.570
Huh? The sky?

17:49.200 --> 17:50.770
There's no way this bike is gonna fly.

17:50.630 --> 17:53.530
It will fly! We have the power to do it if we're together!

17:53.610 --> 17:54.260
Huh?!

17:54.680 --> 17:57.120
That's 'cause you're an angel!

18:03.650 --> 18:04.340
Eh?

18:06.690 --> 18:10.600
H-hot! My back is hot! Oww! Oww!

18:19.090 --> 18:20.010
Wings?

18:26.940 --> 18:28.460
Why do I have wings?

18:29.110 --> 18:30.700
Take a look above your head!

18:32.020 --> 18:32.710
A halo?!

18:33.560 --> 18:35.410
Yeah! An angel's halo!

18:40.590 --> 18:41.140
There it is!

18:41.930 --> 18:44.010
There? So the girl you were interested in is riding that train.

18:44.010 --> 18:44.430
Yeah!

18:44.760 --> 18:47.070
Alright! I'm taking us in closer!

18:56.180 --> 18:57.240
That bike is flying!

18:57.380 --> 18:58.250
It's got wings!

18:58.190 --> 18:59.550
Must be an angel of justice or something!

18:59.630 --> 19:00.810
Then, who's the bad guy?

19:04.250 --> 19:04.860
There!

19:13.070 --> 19:13.880
Kamiyama...

19:33.530 --> 19:35.870
Woah. That was totally wild.

19:36.420 --> 19:38.690
Me growing wings... The bike flying...

19:39.510 --> 19:40.790
What the hell was that?

19:41.500 --> 19:42.290
A miracle.

19:42.980 --> 19:44.060
Just who are you?

19:44.850 --> 19:46.150
M-me?

19:48.590 --> 19:49.830
I'm God.

20:05.540 --> 20:06.560
I'm home!

20:07.020 --> 20:08.670
Welcome home, Samatarou!

20:09.060 --> 20:10.840
Aww, what happened to your face?

20:13.100 --> 20:14.480
You're awfully dirty.

20:14.750 --> 20:17.190
Where were you playing around at? Jeez.

20:17.230 --> 20:19.520
Don't say anything bad about Samatarou!

20:19.850 --> 20:21.640
If someone's going to say something bad, it has to be me!

20:21.800 --> 20:25.230
Why do you get to say it? I don't get it.

20:26.680 --> 20:28.280
What's wrong, Samatarou?

20:28.280 --> 20:29.500
Why're you laughing?

20:30.130 --> 20:30.820
It's nothing.

20:32.490 --> 20:33.950
Here, wipe your face.

20:34.150 --> 20:35.050
Thanks.

20:35.460 --> 20:36.740
You're the best!

20:37.220 --> 20:38.870
What? You a pedo?

20:41.110 --> 20:42.810
So uh, where's Pops?

20:42.890 --> 20:44.340
He's on a business trip in Heaven.

20:44.340 --> 20:46.020
He said he'll be back in awhile.

20:46.310 --> 20:49.500
Which sucks. I've been so bored. Bored bored bored!

20:50.490 --> 20:50.960
Ah.

20:53.300 --> 20:54.190
I'm home.

20:54.600 --> 20:55.230
I'm coming in.

20:55.450 --> 20:56.180
Welcome back.

20:58.990 --> 21:00.430
What're you grinning about?

21:00.820 --> 21:01.530
Something happen?

21:01.830 --> 21:02.590
Not really.

21:04.370 --> 21:05.880
It okay if I keep doing my homework?

21:06.060 --> 21:06.590
Yeah.

21:14.620 --> 21:16.300
God! Jeez. What do you want?!

21:16.450 --> 21:17.670
I can't concentrate if you're there.

21:17.870 --> 21:18.880
If you've got something to say, say it.

21:19.330 --> 21:20.120
I will, then.

21:20.230 --> 21:21.340
So, what's up?

21:22.280 --> 21:23.070
I've got a present for you.

21:23.500 --> 21:24.010
Oh?

21:25.430 --> 21:26.080
Give it over.

21:27.460 --> 21:28.560
Here ya go.

21:28.560 --> 21:30.790
Ah! This is that music box!

21:31.300 --> 21:32.440
C'mon! No way!

21:33.110 --> 21:35.120
Maybe you do have a few good points!

21:35.650 --> 21:39.450
There's a figure of an angel inside, that like, looks just like you!

21:40.130 --> 21:40.910
Really?!

21:41.160 --> 21:44.310
Aww! Then I beat she's really cute!

21:48.290 --> 21:49.490
This doesn't really look like me.

21:49.920 --> 21:51.240
Let's just say it's going to look like you from now on.

21:51.580 --> 21:53.230
What? I don't get what you're saying.

21:53.660 --> 21:55.950
Then, time for part two of your present!

21:56.660 --> 21:57.270
Close your eyes.

21:57.920 --> 21:58.450
Why should I?

21:58.940 --> 21:59.670
C'mon.

22:00.670 --> 22:01.030
No way.

22:01.460 --> 22:02.880
If you don't close 'em, I’m not giving it to you.

22:03.110 --> 22:05.910
Fine. You're such a pain in the ass.

22:10.140 --> 22:11.520
Okay. Here you go.

22:15.400 --> 22:16.640
You! Did you just?!

22:40.200 --> 22:45.690
aru asa totsuzen (uh huh) sekai ga kawattete (kawattete)

22:40.200 --> 22:45.690
The world suddenly changed one morning

22:46.560 --> 22:52.150
kaeri no tochuu de (uh huh) kimi ni kissu sareru no (sareru no)

22:46.560 --> 22:52.150
While we were on the way home, you unexpectedly kissed me

22:52.560 --> 22:56.540
sonna no aru wake nai ka

22:52.560 --> 22:56.540
I doubt something like that would ever happen though

22:59.400 --> 23:04.140
dakara atashi kara ippo fumidasu kedo

22:59.400 --> 23:04.140
That's why my shoulders sank when you stepped away from me

23:05.650 --> 23:10.840
suki na taipu kiite kata wo otoshita

23:05.650 --> 23:10.840
And told me about the kinda girls you like

23:11.080 --> 23:17.430
atama ni doonatsu wo nosete mitemo

23:11.080 --> 23:17.430
Even if you put a doughnut over your head

23:18.310 --> 23:24.550
kore dake ja tenshi ni mienai (nainai kana)

23:18.310 --> 23:24.550
It wouldn't be enough to make you look like an angel!

23:25.820 --> 23:31.770
o~o kamisama onegai (kamisama onegai) kiru sugita maegami

23:25.820 --> 23:31.770
Oh, please, God, allow the bangs I cut too short

23:31.770 --> 23:37.500
sugu modoshitai nanto ka shiteyo

23:31.770 --> 23:37.500
To grow back quickly! You can do it somehow

23:37.530 --> 23:39.380
kotaenasai

23:37.530 --> 23:39.380
Please answer my prayer!

23:39.410 --> 23:47.190
sore ja naykkya ano wanpiisu ga niaeba

23:39.410 --> 23:47.190
Or at least let that one piece look good on me

23:47.230 --> 23:52.360
subete wa umaku iku yo, tabun

23:47.230 --> 23:52.360
Then everything will turn out okay... probably!

24:03.820 --> 24:06.400
I've been awakened! By the love buried inside me!

24:06.460 --> 24:08.540
Where're you going, Shinichi?

24:08.540 --> 24:09.230
So excited!

24:09.230 --> 24:12.580
<i>Sorry, I have no idea what he's saying here after listening to it 5 times.</i>

24:12.580 --> 24:14.350
I've gotta study this too!

24:14.350 --> 24:15.000
*Chirp chirp*

24:15.280 --> 24:18.330
She's definitely my shining angel!

24:18.330 --> 24:20.430
Shinichi, your leg is broken.

24:20.690 --> 24:22.570
Next time on Kamisama Kazoku:

24:22.860 --> 24:25.410
Love Season? The one who's on his mind?

24:22.860 --> 24:25.410
Note: This is a pun. In kanji, it's "season", as in Fall, but in katakana, it's hunting season.

24:25.520 --> 24:27.820
I've got a feeling I met that girl somewhere before...
